OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy start this
OL,6,Fmorning, with outbreaks of rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle, particularly over the hills.
OL,8,FSkies will tend to brighten up for the
OL,9,Fafternoon, with sunny spells and the
OL,10,Fpotential for the odd shower.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAny evening brightness will
OL,13,Fquickly be replaced by cloudy skies
OL,14,Fovernight. Outbreaks of rain will then
OL,15,Fgradually move in during the early
OL,16,Fhours, especially in the north.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FA rather grey and damp day
OL,19,Fwith outbreaks of rain and drizzle,
OL,20,Fwhich may turn heavier later in the
OL,21,Fday. Feeling rather humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
